(5593319, 810142, 100393, '<td valign="top">I think this is probably a great photograph that isn''t well served by DPC image size limits. I think you did the right thing by maintaining this aspect ratio - it is the right aspect ratio for the image, but it doesn''t translate to this size too well. I''ve tried to see past these restrictions and imagine the full size image but in the end the choice of entering such a landscape in this small size might mean it scores less overall than the image deserves.</td>', 'I think this is probably a great photograph that isn''t well served by DPC image size limits. I think you did the right thing by maintaining this aspect ratio - it is the right aspect ratio for the image, but it doesn''t translate to this size too well. I''ve tried to see past these restrictions and imagine the full size image but in the end the choice of entering such a landscape in this small size might mean it scores less overall than the image deserves.', '2009-08-01 03:11:27.000000', NULL, 1),
