(5593695, 804900, 35804, '<td valign="top">That''s a cute little coupe...a thing to keep in mind when photographing cars, as with anything else, is to be mindful of what''s going on in the background. For instance...the giant tree trunk that''s growing up through the middle of the ride. Now I know you can''t remove the tree trunk, and I don''t know if this was a happened upon scene, or what the circumstances were. But even if it''s a <i>found </i>car, meaning it''s just parked there and you don''t know who the owner is, there are so many ways to get some great shots like moving in closer or getting down low....<i>really low</i>. And if you do know the owner, or are the owner...just watch that background. This would be a pretty sweet shot without that darn tree!</td>', 'That''s a cute little coupe...a thing to keep in mind when photographing cars, as with anything else, is to be mindful of what''s going on in the background. For instance...the giant tree trunk that''s growing up through the middle of the ride. Now I know you can''t remove the tree trunk, and I don''t know if this was a happened upon scene, or what the circumstances were. But even if it''s a found car, meaning it''s just parked there and you don''t know who the owner is, there are so many ways to get some great shots like moving in closer or getting down low....really low. And if you do know the owner, or are the owner...just watch that background. This would be a pretty sweet shot without that darn tree!', '2009-08-01 11:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5593696, 810962, 35804, '<td valign="top">I really like the creamy warm tones...like an orange cream, perfect for summertime.</td>', 'I really like the creamy warm tones...like an orange cream, perfect for summertime.', '2009-08-01 11:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5593697, 810658, 65319, '<td valign="top">Well, this photo is a lovely capture of horse and rider (nice title too!...;-)...)  Definitely deserves a 10!</td>', 'Well, this photo is a lovely capture of horse and rider (nice title too!...;-)...)  Definitely deserves a 10!', '2009-08-01 11:50:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5593698, 804044, 65319, '<td valign="top">Hahahaha...7</td>', 'Hahahaha...7', '2009-08-01 11:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
