(5593701, 810243, 54645, '<td valign="top">Great portrait. The back light from the sun is very dramatic. She is lost in her thoughts, despite the flowering plant.</td>', 'Great portrait. The back light from the sun is very dramatic. She is lost in her thoughts, despite the flowering plant.', '2009-08-01 11:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
