(5594071, 810274, 86447, '<td valign="top">I have four kids of my own, but I almost can look at this long enough to comment on it.  Sorry.  It''s not attractive, in my opinion.   (not voting)</td>', 'I have four kids of my own, but I almost can look at this long enough to comment on it.  Sorry.  It''s not attractive, in my opinion.   (not voting)', '2009-08-01 17:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
