(5594110, 810243, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Very nice image - lighting, model, make up, clothing, hand pose, glance, eyes, hair - especially with the natural sunlight.  I like the flower elements too, very nice and feminine, without (apparent) softening too, which works well.  Biggest issue for me is the overall balance and cropping.  Either both shoulders in and more space (obviously) to the right) else a slightly tighter crop on the left.</td>', '7 - Very nice image - lighting, model, make up, clothing, hand pose, glance, eyes, hair - especially with the natural sunlight.  I like the flower elements too, very nice and feminine, without (apparent) softening too, which works well.  Biggest issue for me is the overall balance and cropping.  Either both shoulders in and more space (obviously) to the right) else a slightly tighter crop on the left.', '2009-08-01 18:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5594111, 809618, 39880, '<td valign="top">The heavy HDR makes it look cartoonish.</td>', 'The heavy HDR makes it look cartoonish.', '2009-08-01 18:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5594119, 811007, 65234, '<td valign="top">Like the purples and the darkness.  The dim silhouettes of the trees are particularly nice, and the reflected clouds.  Moon and its reflection are a little harsh in comparison to everything else in the scene..</td>', 'Like the purples and the darkness.  The dim silhouettes of the trees are particularly nice, and the reflected clouds.  Moon and its reflection are a little harsh in comparison to everything else in the scene..', '2009-08-01 18:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5594124, 810739, 65234, '<td valign="top">Like your composition and that you got catchlights in both eyes.  Skin tone looks greenish on my monitor.</td>', 'Like your composition and that you got catchlights in both eyes.  Skin tone looks greenish on my monitor.', '2009-08-01 18:24:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5594127, 810522, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice image and capture.  Visually looks like it needs a nudge up on the left, but your call.  Might have changed it too much and made too sterile for you.  I like you kept the ''brown flaw'' in - I''d probably be tempted to shift the hue to minimize it, maybe, who knows.</td>', '7 - Nice image and capture.  Visually looks like it needs a nudge up on the left, but your call.  Might have changed it too much and made too sterile for you.  I like you kept the ''brown flaw'' in - I''d probably be tempted to shift the hue to minimize it, maybe, who knows.', '2009-08-01 18:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5594129, 810175, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Nice little scene.  720 would have helped you if the quality was there.  It is also too centered for me, likely more room (of course if you had it) to the left and slightly tighter on the right would have given this a compositional edge.  Be nice to see more detail on the ''coon, but difficult, especially when he/she is scurrying along rocks over water.  I like that the heron doesn''t seem too phased and that they both have their own agendas.</td>', '6 - Nice little scene.  720 would have helped you if the quality was there.  It is also too centered for me, likely more room (of course if you had it) to the left and slightly tighter on the right would have given this a compositional edge.  Be nice to see more detail on the ''coon, but difficult, especially when he/she is scurrying along rocks over water.  I like that the heron doesn''t seem too phased and that they both have their own agendas.', '2009-08-01 18:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5594130, 809950, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Good scene, crazy dog.  Wish they dominated the image more.</td>', '6 - Good scene, crazy dog.  Wish they dominated the image more.', '2009-08-01 18:30:30.000000', NULL, 1),
