(5594358, 809338, 43774, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool and artistic. Who knew paper clips could make such an interesting photo?</td>', 'Pretty cool and artistic. Who knew paper clips could make such an interesting photo?', '2009-08-01 20:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5594359, 810726, 43774, '<td valign="top">What gorgeous colours and architecture.</td>', 'What gorgeous colours and architecture.', '2009-08-01 20:43:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5594360, 810912, 43774, '<td valign="top">Love the colours and lighting.</td>', 'Love the colours and lighting.', '2009-08-01 20:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5594361, 809210, 43774, '<td valign="top">Neat capture, very cool.</td>', 'Neat capture, very cool.', '2009-08-01 20:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5594362, 805052, 43774, '<td valign="top">Love the blue tones.</td>', 'Love the blue tones.', '2009-08-01 20:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5594363, 810694, 43774, '<td valign="top">Amazing clouds, very nice composition.</td>', 'Amazing clouds, very nice composition.', '2009-08-01 20:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5594364, 810327, 43774, '<td valign="top">That is a gorgeous tree.</td>', 'That is a gorgeous tree.', '2009-08-01 20:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5594365, 805203, 43774, '<td valign="top">Fireworks that look like..............the sun over a bunch of palm trees.</td>', 'Fireworks that look like..............the sun over a bunch of palm trees.', '2009-08-01 20:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5594366, 810918, 43774, '<td valign="top">A very pretty scene, I love the colours.<br/> <br/>It looks tilted to the right and I''m not fond of the added glow.</td>', 'A very pretty scene, I love the colours. It looks tilted to the right and I''m not fond of the added glow.', '2009-08-01 20:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5594367, 811001, 43774, '<td valign="top">This is quite scary!!</td>', 'This is quite scary!!', '2009-08-01 20:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5594368, 808571, 43774, '<td valign="top">I like the details and textures and it''s interesting because I have no idea what it is. I don''t like the vignette, though, it''s overpowering. Perhaps a more subtle vignette would work.</td>', 'I like the details and textures and it''s interesting because I have no idea what it is. I don''t like the vignette, though, it''s overpowering. Perhaps a more subtle vignette would work.', '2009-08-01 20:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5594369, 810677, 43774, '<td valign="top">Classic photo of this canyon, would love to see it myself.</td>', 'Classic photo of this canyon, would love to see it myself.', '2009-08-01 20:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5594370, 811013, 43774, '<td valign="top">I don''t think I can get photos as clear as this. Amazing.</td>', 'I don''t think I can get photos as clear as this. Amazing.', '2009-08-01 20:45:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5594371, 810256, 43774, '<td valign="top">I know what this is but the way you''ve presented it, it looks so alien. Very cool.</td>', 'I know what this is but the way you''ve presented it, it looks so alien. Very cool.', '2009-08-01 20:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5594417, 809467, 86447, '<td valign="top">Lovely detail.  Good BW conversion.   (not voting)</td>', 'Lovely detail.  Good BW conversion.   (not voting)', '2009-08-01 21:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5594436, 810868, 79955, '<td valign="top">Really great shot !! unique &amp; Detailed. Good luck with the DPC voters because I have the perception that a big chunk of DPC voters do not quite know how to appreciate macros (no vote)</td>', 'Really great shot !! unique & Detailed. Good luck with the DPC voters because I have the perception that a big chunk of DPC voters do not quite know how to appreciate macros (no vote)', '2009-08-01 22:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5594441, 809931, 79955, '<td valign="top">This is a nicely captured potrait. Exposure on the person is great. Unfortunately the background will not go well especially in a FS. Background though natural is distracting with too many bright areas and the tree behind the person distracts. (No vote)</td>', 'This is a nicely captured potrait. Exposure on the person is great. Unfortunately the background will not go well especially in a FS. Background though natural is distracting with too many bright areas and the tree behind the person distracts. (No vote)', '2009-08-01 22:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5594444, 809016, 79955, '<td valign="top">Dramatic to the extreme. Love it , the balance and the colors blend really well. (no vote)</td>', 'Dramatic to the extreme. Love it , the balance and the colors blend really well. (no vote)', '2009-08-01 22:11:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5594446, 810965, 79955, '<td valign="top">Nice tones , would recommend to go in a little closer, increase DOF and go for a centred square crop. A little too much negative space IMO (no vote)</td>', 'Nice tones , would recommend to go in a little closer, increase DOF and go for a centred square crop. A little too much negative space IMO (no vote)', '2009-08-01 22:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5594448, 810811, 79955, '<td valign="top">Great shot !!! should do really well.</td>', 'Great shot !!! should do really well.', '2009-08-01 22:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5594451, 811010, 79955, '<td valign="top">good details , nice exposure. All down to how much the DPC voters like your subject matter  as far as the scoring goes. (no vote)</td>', 'good details , nice exposure. All down to how much the DPC voters like your subject matter  as far as the scoring goes. (no vote)', '2009-08-01 22:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5594452, 811024, 79955, '<td valign="top">Exposure is good. Processed quite nicely. Subject matter unfortunately will be too bland for a FS. (no vote)</td>', 'Exposure is good. Processed quite nicely. Subject matter unfortunately will be too bland for a FS. (no vote)', '2009-08-01 22:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5594453, 803991, 79955, '<td valign="top">excellent details , lovely blend of colors. wish you had included more. (no vote)</td>', 'excellent details , lovely blend of colors. wish you had included more. (no vote)', '2009-08-01 22:19:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5594454, 810707, 79955, '<td valign="top">LOL!! love this shot. I still feel the sky is the let down here. (no vote)</td>', 'LOL!! love this shot. I still feel the sky is the let down here. (no vote)', '2009-08-01 22:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5594455, 809941, 79955, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot. Wonderfully processed. excellent composition. Not too overdone. would have gotten a 10 if  had voted (no vote)</td>', 'Lovely shot. Wonderfully processed. excellent composition. Not too overdone. would have gotten a 10 if  had voted (no vote)', '2009-08-01 22:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5594465, 810910, 79955, '<td valign="top">Nice detail on the legs, but I am unsure of the crop you chose. Maybe  the crop is just a little too tight and does "not" take advantage of the nice background bokeh you captured in this shot (no vote)<br/> <br/>edited to add and important word "not" that I missed out earlier</td>', 'Nice detail on the legs, but I am unsure of the crop you chose. Maybe  the crop is just a little too tight and does "not" take advantage of the nice background bokeh you captured in this shot (no vote) edited to add and important word "not" that I missed out earlier', '2009-08-01 22:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5594469, 810748, 79955, '<td valign="top">Extremely tough subject to capture. These guys are super sensitive. I am betting the the significant cropping done softened the crispness of the shot. Still an excellent macro (no vote)</td>', 'Extremely tough subject to capture. These guys are super sensitive. I am betting the the significant cropping done softened the crispness of the shot. Still an excellent macro (no vote)', '2009-08-01 22:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5594473, 804128, 79955, '<td valign="top">Love this shot , I feel that it is unique and reall well done.  Great job on this !!. (no vote)</td>', 'Love this shot , I feel that it is unique and reall well done.  Great job on this !!. (no vote)', '2009-08-01 22:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5594482, 809702, 79955, '<td valign="top">A lot of potential in this image IMO. The composition you used let this shot down IMO. If you wanted the bed to be on the right as in this shot , I would recommend a more vertically composed shot instead. Currenly I feel that there is just too much space on the left that does not add to the shot (no vote)</td>', 'A lot of potential in this image IMO. The composition you used let this shot down IMO. If you wanted the bed to be on the right as in this shot , I would recommend a more vertically composed shot instead. Currenly I feel that there is just too much space on the left that does not add to the shot (no vote)', '2009-08-01 22:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5594483, 807321, 79955, '<td valign="top">Brilliant shot. Processing is just right , not overdone. Color and tones are pefect. Well may be just a tiny tad crisper in the eyes. Overall an almost perfect shot, well done (no vote)</td>', 'Brilliant shot. Processing is just right , not overdone. Color and tones are pefect. Well may be just a tiny tad crisper in the eyes. Overall an almost perfect shot, well done (no vote)', '2009-08-01 22:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5594484, 810066, 79955, '<td valign="top">a really cool shot IMO. Would have gone for a tigher squarer crop and included less of the top and more of the falls. (no vote)</td>', 'a really cool shot IMO. Would have gone for a tigher squarer crop and included less of the top and more of the falls. (no vote)', '2009-08-01 22:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
