(5595381, 809802, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice lighting, nice quality - I want to see more ''roughness'' on her face.. if that makes sense.  She looks so clean.  I like the forward glance/look - just wish also for a little more ''character'' to shine through - facial expression or something, just to give her/the image a little more of an edge.. if that makes sense.  Also, do miss her legs, but... I appreciate the crop dilemma.  Like the distant sun and its placement too.</td>', '7 - Nice lighting, nice quality - I want to see more ''roughness'' on her face.. if that makes sense.  She looks so clean.  I like the forward glance/look - just wish also for a little more ''character'' to shine through - facial expression or something, just to give her/the image a little more of an edge.. if that makes sense.  Also, do miss her legs, but... I appreciate the crop dilemma.  Like the distant sun and its placement too.', '2009-08-02 15:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
