(5596704, 810701, 19178, '<td valign="top">With it''s strong reliance on geometric shapes, this image is harmed by the slight tilt to the right. The texture of the building in the foreground adds interest.</td>', 'With it''s strong reliance on geometric shapes, this image is harmed by the slight tilt to the right. The texture of the building in the foreground adds interest.', '2009-08-03 09:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5596710, 810918, 19178, '<td valign="top">This photo would work better if it was cropped to place the shoreline 1/3 of the way from the top or the bottom of the frame.  It''s risky to have a horizontal line divide the image near its center.  Try covering up about 1/2 the water or 1/2 of the sky and see what you think.  Good color!</td>', 'This photo would work better if it was cropped to place the shoreline 1/3 of the way from the top or the bottom of the frame.  It''s risky to have a horizontal line divide the image near its center.  Try covering up about 1/2 the water or 1/2 of the sky and see what you think.  Good color!', '2009-08-03 09:39:12.000000', NULL, 1),
