(5600451, 810907, 93283, '<td valign="top">This is kinda funky, but I really like the contrast of the hill against the sky. Whatever it actually is, its a pretty cool shot...</td>', 'This is kinda funky, but I really like the contrast of the hill against the sky. Whatever it actually is, its a pretty cool shot...', '2009-08-05 18:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
