(5600456, 810914, 93283, '<td valign="top">This is the 2nd fireworks shot of the challenge, I would have expected more. I like the silhouettes, and the fireworks are crisp. I think the shot could have benefitted from a portrait view crop, but that''s my very unprofessional opinion :) Overall a good shot though</td>', 'This is the 2nd fireworks shot of the challenge, I would have expected more. I like the silhouettes, and the fireworks are crisp. I think the shot could have benefitted from a portrait view crop, but that''s my very unprofessional opinion :) Overall a good shot though', '2009-08-05 18:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
