(5600463, 811046, 93283, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot, kinda a reverse DoF from what we normally see. It helps make this shot very unique, which normally doesn''t work well around here with some voters... Good luck, its a very cool shot!</td>', 'I really like this shot, kinda a reverse DoF from what we normally see. It helps make this shot very unique, which normally doesn''t work well around here with some voters... Good luck, its a very cool shot!', '2009-08-05 18:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
