(5600596, 808552, 35804, '<td valign="top">Such soft, quiet light...my eye keeps wanting more space around the birds, particularly at the top...more inky blackness. But I have no idea what was above so I really can''t say a different crop or bit of framing would have been an option. There is something unsettling about the crop...I also like that you''ve chosen a B&amp;W conversion, particularly for flamingos, lets us enjoy the textures of the feathers, the silkiness of them.</td>', 'Such soft, quiet light...my eye keeps wanting more space around the birds, particularly at the top...more inky blackness. But I have no idea what was above so I really can''t say a different crop or bit of framing would have been an option. There is something unsettling about the crop...I also like that you''ve chosen a B&W conversion, particularly for flamingos, lets us enjoy the textures of the feathers, the silkiness of them.', '2009-08-05 21:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
