(5601857, 810250, 93283, '<td valign="top">ALthough on this monitor, it appears alittle dark, that is what I really like about this shot. Its darker, but there is an interesting contrast to it. I think its well done, and almost looks like something out of a fantasy world. Truthfully, very artistic and Well done!</td>', 'ALthough on this monitor, it appears alittle dark, that is what I really like about this shot. Its darker, but there is an interesting contrast to it. I think its well done, and almost looks like something out of a fantasy world. Truthfully, very artistic and Well done!', '2009-08-06 20:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5601859, 810653, 93283, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot here. This gentleman has the look of an elder scholar. The lighting is good, and I find it to be overall, a well composed shot...</td>', 'Very interesting shot here. This gentleman has the look of an elder scholar. The lighting is good, and I find it to be overall, a well composed shot...', '2009-08-06 20:19:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5601860, 810986, 93283, '<td valign="top">The colors are nice and the photo is sharp. My only gripe would be that the composition is a bit disorientating.</td>', 'The colors are nice and the photo is sharp. My only gripe would be that the composition is a bit disorientating.', '2009-08-06 20:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5601862, 810452, 93283, '<td valign="top">The composition is good and the exposure is well done. I would have like to have seen alittle more contrast in the grass and hay, but I''m being picky. Overall, its a good shot.</td>', 'The composition is good and the exposure is well done. I would have like to have seen alittle more contrast in the grass and hay, but I''m being picky. Overall, its a good shot.', '2009-08-06 20:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5601864, 811024, 93283, '<td valign="top">Kind of a funky shot. I like the fisheye view of the mirror. The reflection makes the shot interesting.</td>', 'Kind of a funky shot. I like the fisheye view of the mirror. The reflection makes the shot interesting.', '2009-08-06 20:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5601866, 806612, 93283, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, Upon second view I realize I underrated this shot. I love the chaos of the gulls and the exposure is sweet. Very well composed, Nice Shot!</td>', 'Hmmm, Upon second view I realize I underrated this shot. I love the chaos of the gulls and the exposure is sweet. Very well composed, Nice Shot!', '2009-08-06 20:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5601872, 810620, 93283, '<td valign="top">Black and White, and simplicity... two of my favorite things. Also, I really like the DoF here as well.</td>', 'Black and White, and simplicity... two of my favorite things. Also, I really like the DoF here as well.', '2009-08-06 20:25:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5601874, 809467, 93283, '<td valign="top">Crisp and clear. Also, I think the contrast is good as well. The fuzzy reflection is kinda cool too. Overall a good shot. Oh yeah, before I forget, great title borrowed from a Pearl Jam song :) bonus point for the reference...</td>', 'Crisp and clear. Also, I think the contrast is good as well. The fuzzy reflection is kinda cool too. Overall a good shot. Oh yeah, before I forget, great title borrowed from a Pearl Jam song :) bonus point for the reference...', '2009-08-06 20:27:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5601876, 810179, 93283, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is just plain creepy... I hope you sent this in to the local newspaper. Anyway, given the fire against the night, the exposure here is very well done.</td>', 'Wow, this is just plain creepy... I hope you sent this in to the local newspaper. Anyway, given the fire against the night, the exposure here is very well done.', '2009-08-06 20:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5601877, 810924, 93283, '<td valign="top">My first impression of this was that I like the tilt and pose. My only gripe is the contrast on the skin is not very flattering. Exposure and lighting are nice. Subject is good and sharp too... Overall I find it to be an interesting shot</td>', 'My first impression of this was that I like the tilt and pose. My only gripe is the contrast on the skin is not very flattering. Exposure and lighting are nice. Subject is good and sharp too... Overall I find it to be an interesting shot', '2009-08-06 20:29:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5601878, 807629, 93283, '<td valign="top">I love the DoF on this shot. Very cool indeed, I bumped the score up on my second view, its a great shot.</td>', 'I love the DoF on this shot. Very cool indeed, I bumped the score up on my second view, its a great shot.', '2009-08-06 20:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5601880, 806985, 93283, '<td valign="top">Hilarious expression on the little boys face. Very funny shot and the exposure is good too.</td>', 'Hilarious expression on the little boys face. Very funny shot and the exposure is good too.', '2009-08-06 20:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5601881, 810767, 93283, '<td valign="top">While the shot definitely appears interesting, its so small its hard to judge. I realize that DPC restricts size, so that makes shots like this difficult. Okay, from what I can tell, the sky looks really cool, very ambiguous, and I like that. The exposure and lightings appears to be well done. I think the photo has good symmetry and composition as well. Lastly, I''m not going to vote this image down because of size, but allot of other voters might, especially the speed voters.</td>', 'While the shot definitely appears interesting, its so small its hard to judge. I realize that DPC restricts size, so that makes shots like this difficult. Okay, from what I can tell, the sky looks really cool, very ambiguous, and I like that. The exposure and lightings appears to be well done. I think the photo has good symmetry and composition as well. Lastly, I''m not going to vote this image down because of size, but allot of other voters might, especially the speed voters.', '2009-08-06 20:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5601882, 808693, 93283, '<td valign="top">Good lines and composition. The pose is very natural too. The background is a tad distracting though, and the lighting on his face is alittle harsh (While I like this effect, the technical junkies may dock you for it). All in all, this photo has alot of potential. I would love to see this shot with the background blacked out or darkened after the challenge. Lastly, going back to the harsh lighting on the face, I wanted to mention that I like it because it draws the viewers attention right to the subject. Just my two cents, overall I think its a good shot...</td>', 'Good lines and composition. The pose is very natural too. The background is a tad distracting though, and the lighting on his face is alittle harsh (While I like this effect, the technical junkies may dock you for it). All in all, this photo has alot of potential. I would love to see this shot with the background blacked out or darkened after the challenge. Lastly, going back to the harsh lighting on the face, I wanted to mention that I like it because it draws the viewers attention right to the subject. Just my two cents, overall I think its a good shot...', '2009-08-06 20:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5601883, 810906, 93283, '<td valign="top">This is a shot that comes off as surrealistic. I really like it. Some may see it as overprocessed, but I love this look. Reminds me of vacationing with my dad, and when photos that you haven''t taken yourself strike a memory, the original photographer has done a great job. Nice shot...</td>', 'This is a shot that comes off as surrealistic. I really like it. Some may see it as overprocessed, but I love this look. Reminds me of vacationing with my dad, and when photos that you haven''t taken yourself strike a memory, the original photographer has done a great job. Nice shot...', '2009-08-06 20:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5601884, 811043, 93283, '<td valign="top">I think so... Light of sun that is... I like this shot, and the fish eye effect is cool. Its very pleasant to the eye. Nice Shot...</td>', 'I think so... Light of sun that is... I like this shot, and the fish eye effect is cool. Its very pleasant to the eye. Nice Shot...', '2009-08-06 20:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5601885, 810760, 93283, '<td valign="top">Wow, looks like that was all framed up for you... I think the dark characters in the background match the border nicely</td>', 'Wow, looks like that was all framed up for you... I think the dark characters in the background match the border nicely', '2009-08-06 20:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5601886, 811009, 93283, '<td valign="top">That''s either a really big rose, or really small frogs... Either way, I find it to be interesting. Cute title as well, overall, its a good shot</td>', 'That''s either a really big rose, or really small frogs... Either way, I find it to be interesting. Cute title as well, overall, its a good shot', '2009-08-06 20:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5601887, 810766, 93283, '<td valign="top">This is another shot that upon second view, I''m bumping up. THe butterfly is nice and sharp as well as the stem. Awesome DoF and colors, overall a wonderful shot 8</td>', 'This is another shot that upon second view, I''m bumping up. THe butterfly is nice and sharp as well as the stem. Awesome DoF and colors, overall a wonderful shot 8', '2009-08-06 20:34:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5601888, 810998, 93283, '<td valign="top">Very interesting distribution of light. I like the simpleness and the silhouettes in this shot</td>', 'Very interesting distribution of light. I like the simpleness and the silhouettes in this shot', '2009-08-06 20:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5601889, 810932, 93283, '<td valign="top">Very strong capture here. I like the portrait framing too. Lastly, nice contrast, especially in the trees. Well done</td>', 'Very strong capture here. I like the portrait framing too. Lastly, nice contrast, especially in the trees. Well done', '2009-08-06 20:35:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5601892, 810669, 93283, '<td valign="top">There is a certain simpleness to this shot. I like the colors, and I like the fact that there isn''t a bright sun starring me in the face. I think this shot would have worked better if the water was calm and smooth, but overall its still a good shot that''s pleasing to the eye...</td>', 'There is a certain simpleness to this shot. I like the colors, and I like the fact that there isn''t a bright sun starring me in the face. I think this shot would have worked better if the water was calm and smooth, but overall its still a good shot that''s pleasing to the eye...', '2009-08-06 20:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5601895, 808036, 93283, '<td valign="top">While the composition is actually very interesting, the colors are unnatural in this shot. I think its because of either harsh lighting, too much contrast, or both. Anyway, on the plus side, the DoF is good and the subjects are nice and sharp. Overall, not a bad image here, perhaps a better time of day would help set it off...</td>', 'While the composition is actually very interesting, the colors are unnatural in this shot. I think its because of either harsh lighting, too much contrast, or both. Anyway, on the plus side, the DoF is good and the subjects are nice and sharp. Overall, not a bad image here, perhaps a better time of day would help set it off...', '2009-08-06 20:41:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5601899, 810979, 93283, '<td valign="top">This shot is so funny...LOL, that is a sheer look of terror on their faces. They look so nervous, very cute shot, I''m sure their parents love this shot and will torment them by showing it to every girlfriend they bring home until they are married... :)</td>', 'This shot is so funny...LOL, that is a sheer look of terror on their faces. They look so nervous, very cute shot, I''m sure their parents love this shot and will torment them by showing it to every girlfriend they bring home until they are married... :)', '2009-08-06 20:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5601902, 810421, 93283, '<td valign="top">Very serene shot... The lake and mountains look nice, my only critique would be that the color of the sky looks abit unnatural, but that could be my monitor. All in all, its a good shot...</td>', 'Very serene shot... The lake and mountains look nice, my only critique would be that the color of the sky looks abit unnatural, but that could be my monitor. All in all, its a good shot...', '2009-08-06 20:47:01.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5601906, 810887, 93283, '<td valign="top">The composition and color are nice in this shot. I think it may have worked better in landscape framing, with more ocean and less of the top greenery, but that is my very unprofessional opinion :)</td>', 'The composition and color are nice in this shot. I think it may have worked better in landscape framing, with more ocean and less of the top greenery, but that is my very unprofessional opinion :)', '2009-08-06 20:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5601907, 810936, 93283, '<td valign="top">The composition is good, I think a better time of day could have greatly benefitted the lighting for this shot</td>', 'The composition is good, I think a better time of day could have greatly benefitted the lighting for this shot', '2009-08-06 20:49:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5601909, 809538, 93283, '<td valign="top">The color and composition are very good in this shot. My only gripes with this shot would be that the back end of the left wing is out of focus, and the same wing is cut off. That is me being picky though, overall its a good shot...</td>', 'The color and composition are very good in this shot. My only gripes with this shot would be that the back end of the left wing is out of focus, and the same wing is cut off. That is me being picky though, overall its a good shot...', '2009-08-06 20:51:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5601912, 809652, 93283, '<td valign="top">I think this shot could have been amazing with alittle wider DoF. The bees are a tad out of focus, but other than that. The composition and colors are great, and the bokeh in the background is a nice touch as well...</td>', 'I think this shot could have been amazing with alittle wider DoF. The bees are a tad out of focus, but other than that. The composition and colors are great, and the bokeh in the background is a nice touch as well...', '2009-08-06 20:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5601916, 810812, 93283, '<td valign="top">Pretty interesting shot. This is not something you see everyday on DPC and I like that. It appears a tad dark, but this monitor is not calibrated so it may be me. Overall a pretty cool shot</td>', 'Pretty interesting shot. This is not something you see everyday on DPC and I like that. It appears a tad dark, but this monitor is not calibrated so it may be me. Overall a pretty cool shot', '2009-08-06 20:55:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5601922, 811044, 93283, '<td valign="top">Very nice portrait here, love the eyes, and the DoF is good too. Lastly, lighting is nice as well</td>', 'Very nice portrait here, love the eyes, and the DoF is good too. Lastly, lighting is nice as well', '2009-08-06 20:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5601924, 810992, 93283, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot with a great DoF. The contrast and colors are nice as well... Lastly, the border adds a nice touch</td>', 'Very interesting shot with a great DoF. The contrast and colors are nice as well... Lastly, the border adds a nice touch', '2009-08-06 20:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5601934, 809206, 93283, '<td valign="top">The colors and composition are nice, but the subject really isn''t that sharp. I think a wider DoF would have greatly benefitted this shot. Overall an interesting shot, keep thinking outside the box, because it keeps us voters interested :)</td>', 'The colors and composition are nice, but the subject really isn''t that sharp. I think a wider DoF would have greatly benefitted this shot. Overall an interesting shot, keep thinking outside the box, because it keeps us voters interested :)', '2009-08-06 21:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5601937, 809407, 93283, '<td valign="top">The silhouette is very nice in this shot. My only critique would be that the lighting is very harsh. This shot could have greatly benefitted from a better time of day. Overall its a pretty good shot with a good composition.</td>', 'The silhouette is very nice in this shot. My only critique would be that the lighting is very harsh. This shot could have greatly benefitted from a better time of day. Overall its a pretty good shot with a good composition.', '2009-08-06 21:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5601940, 810619, 93283, '<td valign="top">The DoF in this shot is awesome. My only critique of this shot is that its difficult to tell what the bug is doing</td>', 'The DoF in this shot is awesome. My only critique of this shot is that its difficult to tell what the bug is doing', '2009-08-06 21:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5601942, 810292, 93283, '<td valign="top">ummm, at first glance of this shot, I was totally lost. Truthfully, I like that,  I see this shot as almost an abstract landscape. These types of shots tend to score low here on DPC, so I''m giving bonus points for courage :) Anyway, just wanted to say that I really like this very artistic take and I hope you score well</td>', 'ummm, at first glance of this shot, I was totally lost. Truthfully, I like that,  I see this shot as almost an abstract landscape. These types of shots tend to score low here on DPC, so I''m giving bonus points for courage :) Anyway, just wanted to say that I really like this very artistic take and I hope you score well', '2009-08-06 21:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5601943, 811010, 93283, '<td valign="top">Oh what a cutie, reminds me of my dog Abbie. As far as the shot goes, the lighting is alittle uneven and because of that the left side of her face is alitte out of focus. All in all a cute shot, a more even natural light could make this a standout...</td>', 'Oh what a cutie, reminds me of my dog Abbie. As far as the shot goes, the lighting is alittle uneven and because of that the left side of her face is alitte out of focus. All in all a cute shot, a more even natural light could make this a standout...', '2009-08-06 21:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5601945, 809801, 93283, '<td valign="top">hmmm... Very interesting composition and color. I like it and I think its a unique shot.</td>', 'hmmm... Very interesting composition and color. I like it and I think its a unique shot.', '2009-08-06 21:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5601946, 810374, 93283, '<td valign="top">Love the architecture and composition. I think this shot could have benefitted from reducing the cyan just a tad, the lower left hand corner is just alittle too red. Other than that I really like the shot</td>', 'Love the architecture and composition. I think this shot could have benefitted from reducing the cyan just a tad, the lower left hand corner is just alittle too red. Other than that I really like the shot', '2009-08-06 21:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5602004, 808660, 104957, '<td valign="top">A lucky shot and a nice one, too.</td>', 'A lucky shot and a nice one, too.', '2009-08-06 22:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5602005, 810868, 104957, '<td valign="top">I gee hope it´s not very big. Gives me the shivers. I´ll give you a 5 for the nice sharp mandible...</td>', 'I gee hope it´s not very big. Gives me the shivers. I´ll give you a 5 for the nice sharp mandible...', '2009-08-06 22:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
