(5602698, 810334, 37845, '<td valign="top">I have seen hundreds of flower photos, and normally I pass them over quite quickly. Your on the other hand demanded a longer look. I love the soft feel, and the high saturation in the centre, and low saturation toward the edges. Excellent photo of a well known subject.</td>', 'I have seen hundreds of flower photos, and normally I pass them over quite quickly. Your on the other hand demanded a longer look. I love the soft feel, and the high saturation in the centre, and low saturation toward the edges. Excellent photo of a well known subject.', '2009-08-07 13:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5602699, 809213, 37845, '<td valign="top">The strength of this photo is definitely in its colours. Great balance between the warm and cold tones.</td>', 'The strength of this photo is definitely in its colours. Great balance between the warm and cold tones.', '2009-08-07 13:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5602704, 810243, 67258, '<td valign="top">This is simply stunning.  The model is very beautiful, which always helps the photographer, but it is also a shot that is beautifully executed.  The use of light is really good, as are all the technicals, but it is the styling that marks this out for me - lovely.</td>', 'This is simply stunning.  The model is very beautiful, which always helps the photographer, but it is also a shot that is beautifully executed.  The use of light is really good, as are all the technicals, but it is the styling that marks this out for me - lovely.', '2009-08-07 13:16:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5602706, 810710, 37845, '<td valign="top">Oh thank Goodness... you found my car!!!</td>', 'Oh thank Goodness... you found my car!!!', '2009-08-07 13:20:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5602717, 810274, 37845, '<td valign="top">I think this is one of the best shots in the free study. Looks like he just finished a bout of crying, and suddenly started to smile. My nephew does this... he will cry, and completely turn it around and smile a moment later. Some voters might be turned off by the boogies from his nose, but I think it makes this shot.</td>', 'I think this is one of the best shots in the free study. Looks like he just finished a bout of crying, and suddenly started to smile. My nephew does this... he will cry, and completely turn it around and smile a moment later. Some voters might be turned off by the boogies from his nose, but I think it makes this shot.', '2009-08-07 13:35:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5602718, 804123, 37845, '<td valign="top">I love that you cut off his head, I think that is was separates this shot from a simple snapshot. Great perspective as well.</td>', 'I love that you cut off his head, I think that is was separates this shot from a simple snapshot. Great perspective as well.', '2009-08-07 13:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5602719, 810865, 37845, '<td valign="top">Such a proud and grown up expression for such a little girl. Great photo.</td>', 'Such a proud and grown up expression for such a little girl. Great photo.', '2009-08-07 13:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
