(5602757, 809211, 68546, '<td valign="top">great expression and lighting on this one! nice and sharp focus as well. Only thing im not sure about is the crop at the top, feels a little tight. Great smile though!</td>', 'great expression and lighting on this one! nice and sharp focus as well. Only thing im not sure about is the crop at the top, feels a little tight. Great smile though!', '2009-08-07 14:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5602761, 809951, 68546, '<td valign="top">the crop is very odd on this one! I''m not too worried about it being so close on the right, it''s just not very well balanced? Also there are some strange light halos around the socks? Very interesting with good lighting but doesn''t really work IMHO</td>', 'the crop is very odd on this one! I''m not too worried about it being so close on the right, it''s just not very well balanced? Also there are some strange light halos around the socks? Very interesting with good lighting but doesn''t really work IMHO', '2009-08-07 14:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
