(5603617, 808660, 79955, '<td valign="top">Remarkable capture, great timing. you should be proud of this capture.</td>', 'Remarkable capture, great timing. you should be proud of this capture.', '2009-08-08 02:27:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(5603618, 808439, 83313, '<td valign="top">Came in within the range I anticipated for this. Freestudies are tough and a mid-pack entry is a really good photograph. The good thing about a freestudy is you can use ANY photo from the month. The bad thing is, so can everyone else! Good job.</td>', 'Came in within the range I anticipated for this. Freestudies are tough and a mid-pack entry is a really good photograph. The good thing about a freestudy is you can use ANY photo from the month. The bad thing is, so can everyone else! Good job.', '2009-08-08 02:29:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(5603619, 810912, 79955, '<td valign="top">Michelle wonderful shot. This style is becoming yr signature and it is marvellous.</td>', 'Michelle wonderful shot. This style is becoming yr signature and it is marvellous.', '2009-08-08 02:30:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(5603620, 807589, 63812, '<td valign="top">congrats! WTG!</td>', 'congrats! WTG!', '2009-08-08 02:31:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(5603621, 810680, 83313, '<td valign="top">Oops. Usually when I geuss, I''m wrong, but you must admit, it looks like a shot from the same session as <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=103142" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">vawendy</a>''s ribbon winner in life &amp; death.</td>', 'Oops. Usually when I geuss, I''m wrong, but you must admit, it looks like a shot from the same session as  vawendy''s ribbon winner in life & death.', '2009-08-08 02:32:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(5603622, 810397, 81530, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your top 10 buddy.</td>', 'Congrats on your top 10 buddy.', '2009-08-08 02:34:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(5603623, 810784, 83313, '<td valign="top">Didn''t come up for me in voting, but it caught my eye while browsing the results. Very nice! I think you conveyed what you were after.</td>', 'Didn''t come up for me in voting, but it caught my eye while browsing the results. Very nice! I think you conveyed what you were after.', '2009-08-08 02:34:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(5603625, 807940, 5728, '<td valign="top">Coool! Thanks for all the votes and comments, muchly appreciated. This was a portrait I did for a customer who was wanting a kind of 1929''s effect. I used the NIK Silver Efex plugin in for Photoshop, which I find is the best B&amp;W converter I know, I use it often for this kind of work. It is still a big thrill getting a ribbon here at DPC, even after all these years of being here.</td>', 'Coool! Thanks for all the votes and comments, muchly appreciated. This was a portrait I did for a customer who was wanting a kind of 1929''s effect. I used the NIK Silver Efex plugin in for Photoshop, which I find is the best B&W converter I know, I use it often for this kind of work. It is still a big thrill getting a ribbon here at DPC, even after all these years of being here.', '2009-08-08 02:37:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(5603626, 809703, 83313, '<td valign="top">Too bad this was not appreciated by some folks, but from the votes and the other comments I can tell you really hit a home run with a lot of folks, including myself.I gave it a 10 and a fave. One of those mid-pack successes that I prefer over a high scoring entry.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-08-08 01:39:03.</i></td>', 'Too bad this was not appreciated by some folks, but from the votes and the other comments I can tell you really hit a home run with a lot of folks, including myself.I gave it a 10 and a fave. One of those mid-pack successes that I prefer over a high scoring entry.', '2009-08-08 02:38:00.000000', '2009-08-08 02:39:03.000000', 0),
(5603632, 808503, 83313, '<td valign="top">This didn''t come up for me in voting, but I love it. Great title too! Just added it as a fave. I see you had some of the same issues that I do with banding from shooting straight into the sun. Very hard to get a perfectly smooth gradient out of that. I reedited my own entry an hour before the challenge because of it.</td>', 'This didn''t come up for me in voting, but I love it. Great title too! Just added it as a fave. I see you had some of the same issues that I do with banding from shooting straight into the sun. Very hard to get a perfectly smooth gradient out of that. I reedited my own entry an hour before the challenge because of it.', '2009-08-08 02:47:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(5603633, 810833, 45475, '<td valign="top">That average for the commenters sure is sweet to look at. Would have been higher too, had I voted! I''m so very glad to see the score came up for you Sarah. That low start was a disgrace and very undeserving.</td>', 'That average for the commenters sure is sweet to look at. Would have been higher too, had I voted! I''m so very glad to see the score came up for you Sarah. That low start was a disgrace and very undeserving.', '2009-08-08 02:49:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(5603634, 809596, 83313, '<td valign="top">Didn''t come up for me in voting, but when I passed by it reviewing the results, I did a double take and returned to it because I recognized your style of street photography. Nice catch.</td>', 'Didn''t come up for me in voting, but when I passed by it reviewing the results, I did a double take and returned to it because I recognized your style of street photography. Nice catch.', '2009-08-08 02:50:24.000000', NULL, 0),
