(5603917, 809179, 81530, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by david_c:</b></div><hr/><i> Well, where were you to get this angle if <b><i>not</i></b> on the bridge?? It''s an great shot anyway. You should have got more comments. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I was along the railing where we took photos of the falls when we met up, but just a little closer to the falls. I had to get there 1 hour before hand because of all the people who come to watch.</td>', 'Originally posted by david_c: Well, where were you to get this angle if not on the bridge?? It''s an great shot anyway. You should have got more comments.   I was along the railing where we took photos of the falls when we met up, but just a little closer to the falls. I had to get there 1 hour before hand because of all the people who come to watch.', '2009-08-08 10:55:05.000000', NULL, 0),
