(5603984, 810701, 76335, '<td valign="top">I''ll elaborate. This was one of my top picks (which could only be bad for you). Compositionally, there''s some interesting stuff here -- lines, shadows, textures. I might have composed it more along rule-of-thirds lines. There''s good geometry and it has (for me) an appealing abstract feel. Good job! (Scores are fast becoming meaningless around here, so don''t be too put off by it.)</td>', 'I''ll elaborate. This was one of my top picks (which could only be bad for you). Compositionally, there''s some interesting stuff here -- lines, shadows, textures. I might have composed it more along rule-of-thirds lines. There''s good geometry and it has (for me) an appealing abstract feel. Good job! (Scores are fast becoming meaningless around here, so don''t be too put off by it.)', '2009-08-08 11:40:18.000000', NULL, 0),
