(5604114, 809394, 68504, '<td valign="top">Fine shot.  Not in-your-face dramatic. It tells me the sort of things I am interested in here:  the colours and hint of textures of the scrub and the different shapes and distances of the background hills/mountains/volcanic risings.</td>', 'Fine shot.  Not in-your-face dramatic. It tells me the sort of things I am interested in here:  the colours and hint of textures of the scrub and the different shapes and distances of the background hills/mountains/volcanic risings.', '2009-08-08 13:52:14.000000', NULL, 0),
