(5604211, 810656, 66384, '<td valign="top">I like the way the rows of the field lead into the center of the rows of towers. I thought of you as we drove home from MI and I saw the fields and power lines.</td>', 'I like the way the rows of the field lead into the center of the rows of towers. I thought of you as we drove home from MI and I saw the fields and power lines.', '2009-08-08 16:35:35.000000', NULL, 0),
