(5604800, 810817, 87808, '<td valign="top">HI from the CC Club<br/> <br/>Good photo!!Very hard to get lightning with so much ambient light going on. You did really well with th editing otherwise the lighting would hardly be visible. <br/> <br/>A little sharper would have helped but bar that, I can see nothing much else you can with this shot, well done!</td>', 'HI from the CC Club Good photo!!Very hard to get lightning with so much ambient light going on. You did really well with th editing otherwise the lighting would hardly be visible.  A little sharper would have helped but bar that, I can see nothing much else you can with this shot, well done!', '2009-08-09 13:27:05.000000', NULL, 0),
