(5605935, 810872, 49773, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by undieyatch:</b></div><hr/><i> Platino V2 action? is interesting. I don''t think I have heard of it before. In a cursory search I don''t seem to find much about it. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by salmiakki:</b></div><hr/><i> I also couldn''t find the action when I googled it. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>PM with your e-mails, I''ll send it over to you. It used to be available for a free download at <a href="//atncentral.com/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">ATN central</a> but not anymore...<br/> <br/>P.S. Deb, that''s a nice voters/commmenters ratio.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-08-10 10:20:08.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by undieyatch: Platino V2 action? is interesting. I don''t think I have heard of it before. In a cursory search I don''t seem to find much about it.   Originally posted by salmiakki: I also couldn''t find the action when I googled it.   PM with your e-mails, I''ll send it over to you. It used to be available for a free download at ATN central but not anymore... P.S. Deb, that''s a nice voters/commmenters ratio.', '2009-08-10 11:17:28.000000', '2009-08-10 11:20:08.000000', 0),
