(5607747, 810967, 67697, '<td valign="top">What I liked about this was the blade kind of bisecting or merging with the beak.  Then as you stare at that, the two eyes pop out at you.  Then you start to wonder where the beak really is lol.  Cool capture.</td>', 'What I liked about this was the blade kind of bisecting or merging with the beak.  Then as you stare at that, the two eyes pop out at you.  Then you start to wonder where the beak really is lol.  Cool capture.', '2009-08-11 18:52:07.000000', NULL, 0),
