(5607751, 810189, 67697, '<td valign="top">I really liked the selective desat - if that happened - i can''t tell.  But the colors on the dresses really held their own here.  It''s like looking at one of those paint splatter pieces of art.  Very cool.</td>', 'I really liked the selective desat - if that happened - i can''t tell.  But the colors on the dresses really held their own here.  It''s like looking at one of those paint splatter pieces of art.  Very cool.', '2009-08-11 18:55:33.000000', NULL, 0),
