(5608927, 810642, 67697, '<td valign="top">Eeewww when are you starting your bug collection book?  How do you find these things?  (I''m assuming that it''s dead or stunned)  Great capture of color in the flowers.</td>', 'Eeewww when are you starting your bug collection book?  How do you find these things?  (I''m assuming that it''s dead or stunned)  Great capture of color in the flowers.', '2009-08-12 10:29:23.000000', NULL, 0),
