(5609048, 810243, 95551, '<td valign="top">OMG!  She is so beautiful!  Great shot.  I love the light.</td>', 'OMG!  She is so beautiful!  Great shot.  I love the light.', '2009-08-12 12:22:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(5609096, 810243, 33889, '<td valign="top">Absolutely gorgeous!</td>', 'Absolutely gorgeous!', '2009-08-12 13:24:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(5609112, 807945, 69668, '<td valign="top">Congrats Timmy...a beautiful image.  Nice to see your work here....I am gald you are still posting.  Congrats again!!</td>', 'Congrats Timmy...a beautiful image.  Nice to see your work here....I am gald you are still posting.  Congrats again!!', '2009-08-12 13:41:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(5609196, 806152, 16912, '<td valign="top">Greetings from Andi via the Critique Club<br/> <br/><b>First Impression:</b> A nice shot and the isolation works well and as your lone commenter suggests a little more isolation would have made this even better. This appears to be a candid shot and whilst I''d not suggest you staged it if the singled out boy had been in blue with the rest in brown this would have been closer to a 7 than a 6 imho.<br/> <br/><b>Composition:</b> I like the composition and reading your comments makes it all the more poignant.<br/> <br/><b>Subject:</b> Its good to see the boys washed and in clean clothes ready for food even though they are homeless. Its sad but imho if the boys were in rags you''d probably have scored a few tenths higher.<br/> <br/><b>Technical:</b> The light on the boys faces is great and the overall exposure is spot on for me. Great focus/dof<br/> <br/><b>Final thoughts:</b> A great shot, maybe not something that would get hung on a wall but as social history it hits the mark. This got a 7 from me during voting btw.</td>', 'Greetings from Andi via the Critique Club First Impression: A nice shot and the isolation works well and as your lone commenter suggests a little more isolation would have made this even better. This appears to be a candid shot and whilst I''d not suggest you staged it if the singled out boy had been in blue with the rest in brown this would have been closer to a 7 than a 6 imho. Composition: I like the composition and reading your comments makes it all the more poignant. Subject: Its good to see the boys washed and in clean clothes ready for food even though they are homeless. Its sad but imho if the boys were in rags you''d probably have scored a few tenths higher. Technical: The light on the boys faces is great and the overall exposure is spot on for me. Great focus/dof Final thoughts: A great shot, maybe not something that would get hung on a wall but as social history it hits the mark. This got a 7 from me during voting btw.', '2009-08-12 14:58:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(5609275, 809016, 28322, '<td valign="top">very well done budd :)</td>', 'very well done budd :)', '2009-08-12 16:58:46.000000', NULL, 0),
