(5624471, 807793, 64733, '<td valign="top">Sorry that my interest in abstract macros is not the interest of most of the group.  I will continue to take photos like this because I like to keep people guessing.  The fact that you didn''t know what the subject was means this was a successful picture to me.<br/> <br/>Oh, and it''s not an elbow.  It''s an upper lip/cheek of a contractor after sanding drywall on a hot day.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-08-26 06:55:40.</i></td>', 'Sorry that my interest in abstract macros is not the interest of most of the group.  I will continue to take photos like this because I like to keep people guessing.  The fact that you didn''t know what the subject was means this was a successful picture to me. Oh, and it''s not an elbow.  It''s an upper lip/cheek of a contractor after sanding drywall on a hot day.', '2009-08-26 07:54:30.000000', '2009-08-26 07:55:40.000000', 0),
