(5655703, 807027, 108982, '<td valign="top">I too, was one of you 10''s; I could not agree with MM more.  I am new to photography and I certainly do not have a technically trained eye.  I am learning every day. However I do know what pleases the senses and this picture is absolutely astonishing!  To date, bar none, this is my favorite DPC photo.  I have returned to it time and time again and still cannot put a fix on exactly why the photo invokes such a strong reaction in me.  Thanks for your effort.</td>', 'I too, was one of you 10''s; I could not agree with MM more.  I am new to photography and I certainly do not have a technically trained eye.  I am learning every day. However I do know what pleases the senses and this picture is absolutely astonishing!  To date, bar none, this is my favorite DPC photo.  I have returned to it time and time again and still cannot put a fix on exactly why the photo invokes such a strong reaction in me.  Thanks for your effort.', '2009-09-21 11:45:06.000000', NULL, 0),
