(5672509, 810974, 69008, '<td valign="top">This is wonderfully serene and very relaxing to view.  I like the dock and reflection in the composition too. I have been told that it helps to have the horizon either above or below the center line of a shot like this. It gives it more a more dynamic feel. Maybe the lack of that off center dynamic helps to create the feeling of stillness in this shot, so it''s all good.</td>', 'This is wonderfully serene and very relaxing to view.  I like the dock and reflection in the composition too. I have been told that it helps to have the horizon either above or below the center line of a shot like this. It gives it more a more dynamic feel. Maybe the lack of that off center dynamic helps to create the feeling of stillness in this shot, so it''s all good.', '2009-10-03 02:11:31.000000', NULL, 0),
