(5680064, 804123, 30982, '<td valign="top">I must not have voted this FS (I don''t see my red bar).  This is phenominal!  Nice sense of from where/to where with the "where" being immaterial, only the going and coming being of consequence.  Great work with the tones and vignetting to create and contain the world here, too.</td>', 'I must not have voted this FS (I don''t see my red bar).  This is phenominal!  Nice sense of from where/to where with the "where" being immaterial, only the going and coming being of consequence.  Great work with the tones and vignetting to create and contain the world here, too.', '2009-10-08 06:23:34.000000', NULL, 0),
