(6600476, 804123, 49018, '<td valign="top">And fast.. <br/>Beautiful image. At first and without reading the title, it made me think of a child and of the joy of running. So I found the contrast a bit disconcerting. Dark, harsh and less luminous than I would have liked.  But then I finally realized the mood of the image, and it certainly works well.</td>', 'And fast.. Beautiful image. At first and without reading the title, it made me think of a child and of the joy of running. So I found the contrast a bit disconcerting. Dark, harsh and less luminous than I would have liked.  But then I finally realized the mood of the image, and it certainly works well.', '2011-11-21 19:48:06.000000', NULL, 0),
